    <blockquote expandable="">
     An ultra-cinematic logo animation set in a hyper-realistic digital void. Glowing particles and holographic code drift in slow motion, gradually forming the letters of AMINIYT — each built with a different material: chrome shards for A, plasma beams for M, molten gold for I, neon crystal for N, liquid mercury for I, holographic glass for Y, and energy fragments for T. Giant chrome semicircles spiral in with electromagnetic energy, locking around the letters with a futuristic click. A digital supernova bursts from the center, revealing the tagline ABSTRACT LOGO in glowing holographic text. The camera pulls back, revealing the logo suspended in a cyberpunk-inspired digital universe with flowing data streams, shimmering lights, and glitching stars. Everything pulses once with energy and fades to black. High detail, cinematic lighting, volumetric glow, sci-fi sound design, advanced motion graphics. --ar 16:9 --v 5
